<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>I am just a branch, and You’re the vine.</l><l>As I dwell in You, everything is fine.</l><l>Here I’d like to be, Lord, all the time.</l><l>Here I’m Yours, dear Lord, and You are mine.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I’m a branch that’s been, Lord, grafted in.</l><l>I’m supplied in You in this life union.</l><l>Here Your riches, Lord, in this sweet life flow.</l><l>As I dwell in You, I will surely grow.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>As I dwell in You, and You in me,</l><l>Here I’m joined to You, Lord, practically.</l><l>As I stay with You, as You’re with me,</l><l>We will mingle, Lord, subjectively.</l></lg>
<lg label="5."><l>As I’m loving You and enjoying You, Lord,</l><l>You become in me the rhema word.</l><l>Here I’ll pray in You as You pray in me.</l><l>You’ll bear fruit in me, Lord, abundantly.</l></lg>
<lg label="6."><l>As I dwell in You, Lord You’re flowing through.</l><l>Lord, You’re filling me, overflowing too.</l><l>Here we all are one and expressing You.</l><l>Here our joy is full as we dwell in You.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
